Cell["\<\
The inverse transform returns {r, theta, phi} in MathWorld order. Mod \
normalizes the azimuth to 0 <= theta < 2 Pi. The angular coordinates are not \
uniquely defined on the polar axis or at the origin.\
\>", "Text", ExpressionUUID->"45638c87-e82a-4cbc-9771-8abe3d94093e"],

